 ],
 "text": "72 out of a hundred support tickets answered without anyone on the team touching them. That is an apparel brand we work with in Berlin. Their team was drowning in where is my order emails, sizing questions, and refund requests in four languages. So we built a system that answers the routine ones on its own, around the clock. When a customer tries to cancel, it offers a better option first. One in four of them stayed. That is 180,000 euros a year they kept. And anything tricky goes to a person with the full story ready. Want the same for your store? Comment Systems and we will send you how it works."
